    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1533">

                <pb facs="0985" n="869" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg869"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.51/57.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Agent Carothers.</hi><anchor n="141"
                        xml:id="d1533-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-16T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1914, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We have just learned that two of the Brothers of the Christian School of
                    Zacatecas have been killed and eleven imprisoned. Please bring the matter to the
                    attention of the Constitutionalist authorities at once, and use your influence
                    to secure the release of the Brothers <pb facs="0986" n="870" xml:id="pg870"/>
                    in prison, and secure the punishment of those responsible for the killing of the
                    two killed. Also make inquiry about other religious orders, urging upon the
                    authorities the imperative importance of giving protection to persons and
                    property of those engaged in religious teaching. Please report whether you have
                    any way of assisting those at Zacatecas. American Consul Saltillo has been
                    instructed in same sense.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1533-f1" n="141" type="source" xml:id="d1533-f1-content">
                <p>Same telegram to the American Vice Consul at Saltillo.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
